---
source: crates/runtime/tests/search/mod.rs
description: "SELECT id, trunc(_score, 3) as _score FROM vector_search(qs, 'secondary', answer) WHERE subject != 'math' ORDER BY _score DESC, id LIMIT 4"
---
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                     |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: _score DESC NULLS FIRST, vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer).id ASC NULLS LAST, fetch=4                                                                   |
|               |   Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer).id, trunc(vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer)._score, Int64(3)) AS _score                            |
|               |     TableScan: vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer) projection=[_score, id], full_filters=[vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), answer).subject != Utf8("math")] |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [_score@1 DESC, id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], fetch=4                                                                                                   |
|               |   SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@1 DESC, id@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                       |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[CAST(key@0 AS Int64) as id, trunc(1 - distance@1, 3) as _score]                                                                                |
|               |       CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |         BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                               |
|               |           RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                           |
|               |             CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                              |
|               |               S3VectorsQueryExec (INDEX_NAME_1): filter={subject:{$ne:"math"}} limit=100                                                                                 |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                          |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
